is nails a Craig Cash-style voiceover for Gurubox, delivering warmth, wit and spot-on northern narration.\",\"uploadDate\":\"2024-04-01T00:00:00+00:00\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container page-header-nav-wrap","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-content","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Craig Cash Impression - Gurubox Fishing"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Spot-On Craig Cash Impression for Gurubox's Fishing Parody</p>"}}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-arrows","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/qatar-drone-race-psg-voiceover","className":"page-header-arrow","title":"PSG Qatar Drone Race Football Commentator","aria-label":"Previous: PSG Qatar Drone Race Football Commentator","children":"‹"}],["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/masked-singer-voice-of-god-butlins","className":"page-header-arrow","title":"Butlins Voice of God - The Masked Singer","aria-label":"Next: Butlins Voice of God - The Masked Singer","children":"›"}]]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Mastering the Art of Craig Cash's Voice</h2>\r\n<p>When Gurubox sought a voice artist who could authentically emulate Craig Cash's soft-spoken Mancunian tone, they turned to me. My extensive experience in character voiceovers, including a variety of <a href=\"/character-voiceover\" title=\"character impressions\">character impressions</a>, made me the ideal choice. This project allowed me to showcase my ability to capture the nuances of Craig's distinctive narration style, adding a unique touch to their content.</p>\r\n"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/OmVuCVXsWM4","title":"Craig Cash Impression - Gurubox Fishing","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/craig-cash-gogglebox-voiceover.jpg","alt":"craig-cash-gogglebox-voiceover","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Gurubox: A Hilarious Fishing Parody</h2>\r\n<p>Gurubox is a clever parody of the popular UK TV show Gogglebox, tailored for the angling community. In this series, anglers watch and humorously comment on fishing videos, mirroring the original show's format. By providing a spot-on Craig Cash impression for the narration, I helped Gurubox deliver an authentic and entertaining experience that resonated with their audience.</p>\r\n"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Need a Character Voice?</h2>  \r\n<p>If you’re looking for a spot-on impression or a unique character voice, <a href=\"/character-voiceover\" title=\"Character Voiceovers\">check out my character work here</a>. Need something bespoke? <a href=\"mailto:guy@Voiceoverguy.co.uk?subject=VoiceoverGuy Website Enquiry\" title=\"eMail Guy direct now\">Get in touch</a></p>\r\n"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"Craig Cash Impression - Gurubox Fishing","pageUrl":"craig-cash-gogglebox-voiceover"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[